Here's a simplified version for the
purposes of getting down to the basics.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.900
When you think about a growth
hacking funnel, because so

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.500
much of it is oriented to the website,

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:23.810
it starts off with getting visitors into
that funnel, visitors to that website.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.180
Then it's about activating members.

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:29.150
And what activate really talks
