But it's getting that action that says,

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:43.880
all right,
I'm interested in going further with you.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.430
And then it's about retention.

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:50.030
And retention is about getting people
to use that product regularly.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.380
Or use that service regularly.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:55.740
So you're looking at visitors,
activation and retention.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.910
And we're going to get deep
into each of those and

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:00.800
some of the basic principles
that growth hacker uses.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.863
Now conversion rate relative to that
funnel is something that a growth hacker

00:16:05.863 --> 00:16:07.140
is constantly looking at.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:12.020
And that conversion rate really is, again
that idea of when you move through each

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:16.613
section of that funnel, what's going
on in terms of my conversion rate from

00:16:16.613 --> 00:16:21.020
getting people there keep activating
them to actually retaining them.

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:25.353
And another thing that a growth hacker
is constantly thinking about is, boy,

00:16:25.353 --> 00:16:29.423
