00:16:33.942 --> 00:16:36.070
they're not the right users.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:39.650
So my conversion rate into
activation may greatly change.

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:42.151
Or perhaps now I've got
people activating but

00:16:42.151 --> 00:16:46.201
the way that I did it made everyone
activate but I'm not retaining anyone.

00:16:46.201 --> 00:16:50.932
So a growth hacker is looking at those
conversion rates also as indications of

00:16:50.932 --> 00:16:54.660
are my programs working to move
people through that funnel?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:58.030
Now a question that we often talk about,

