00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.810
People will publish the type of
conversion rates that they're seeing.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.270
You can also enter into
the idea of a buddy system.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.160
As long as there's not competition,
