00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:49.740
So let's talk about how we
actually get people moving.

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:51.410
Let's talk about getting visitors.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:57.220
There are essentially three ways that
visitors will get into your funnel.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.830
One is the pull methodology,
so they find you.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.680
Some people call that inbound marketing,
so

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.240
it's enabling people to
find where you live.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:07.640
There's pushing, so
really going to where they are.

