00:18:53.615 --> 00:18:56.650
It's social media,
which you are all familiar with.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.650
And finally it's this idea of
leveraging other people's audiences.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:04.200
Let me give you a great example of that,
when Air B&amp;B first started,

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:09.270
out of their marketing efforts they were
looking at, well how do we get people to

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:13.290
