00:19:46.668 --> 00:19:49.290
So they were leveraging
someone else's network.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:52.980
So little bit different tactic that you
see in the growth casting environment.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:54.960
Is this idea of leveraging
other people's networks.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.830
But for
the most part getting people the top

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:01.180
looks a whole lot like
traditional inbound marketing.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:04.420
Let's talk about the push tactics, again,

